id: CTB-SRC0015-2-2
source: SRC-0015
section: §2.2
kind: requirement
extends: LXM-REQ-000196
text: Every registered technology or tool may declare, as applicable: Its identity, category, provider, provenance and discovery mechanism. Its capabilities, requirements, dependencies and compatibility constraints. Its available versions, release channels and lifecycle status. Its security posture, vulnerability information and maintenance status. Its supported environments, architectures and execution requirements. Its licensing and operational constraints. Its installation, build, test and verification interfaces. Its configuration, resolution and dependency relationships. Its verification evidence, approval status and permitted uses. Its upgrade, replacement, rollback and deprecation procedures.
